 94:     3. Create an S3 bucket (e.g., `scholar-flow-uploads`) and note the region (e.g., `us-east-1`)
 95: 
 96: - Stripe (payments; optional in MVP)
 97:   - STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
 98:   - How: [Stripe Dashboard (test API keys)](https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys); install Stripe CLI to obtain and forward webhooks
 99:   - Dev Webhook URL: `http://localhost:5000/webhooks/stripe`
