101: - SSLCommerz (BD local payments; optional)
102:   - STORE_ID, STORE_PASS, SUCCESS_URL, CANCEL_URL, FAIL_URL, SSL_PAYMENT_API, SSL_VALIDATIOIN_API
103:   - How: Sandbox credentials from [SSLCommerz Developer](https://developer.sslcommerz.com/)
104:   - Dev URLs: `http://localhost:3000/payment/{success|cancel|fail}`
