274: 
275: ## 🐛 Troubleshooting
276: 
277: ### Common Issues
278: 
279: ### Dependency Conflicts
280: 
281: ```bash
282: rm -rf node_modules .yarn/cache
283: yarn install
284: ```
285: 
286: ### Database Connection
287: 
288: - Ensure PostgreSQL is running
289: - Check DATABASE_URL format
290: - Install pgvector extension: `CREATE EXTENSION vector;`
291: 
292: ### Build Errors
293: 
294: ```bash
295: yarn type-check  # Check for TypeScript errors
