298: 
299: ## 📞 Support
300: 
301: - Review the [comprehensive specification](README.md) for detailed requirements
302: - Check the [database schema](apps/backend/prisma/schema.prisma) for data models
303: - Examine API routes in `apps/backend/src/routes/` for endpoint documentation
304: 
305: The template is ready for development and includes all the foundational elements specified in the original requirements. You can now start implementing specific features based on your priorities.
</file>

