<file path="figma-make/guidelines/design-system.md">
  1: # ScholarFlow Design System Guidelines
  2: 
  3: ## Brand Identity
  4: 
  5: **Name:** ScholarFlow  
  6: **Tagline:** AI-Powered Research Paper Collaboration Hub  
  7: **Style:** Modern, clean, professional with gradient accents
  8: 
  9: ---
 10: 
 11: ## Color Palette
 12: 
 13: ### Primary Colors
 14: 
 15: - **Primary (Indigo):** #6366F1
 16: - **Accent (Orange):** #F97316
 17: - **Gradient:** Linear from Primary to Accent
 18: 
 19: ### Semantic Colors
 20: 
 21: - **Success (Green):** #22C55E
 22: - **Warning (Amber):** #F59E0B
 23: - **Info (Blue):** #3B82F6
 24: - **Destructive (Red):** #EF4444
 25: 
 26: ### Neutrals
 27: 
 28: - **Background:** #FFFFFF (light) / #0F172A (dark)
 29: - **Foreground:** #0F172A (light) / #F8FAFC (dark)
 30: - **Muted:** #64748B
 31: - **Border:** #E2E8F0
 32: 
 33: ---
 34: 
 35: ## Typography
 36: 
 37: ### Font Family
 38: 
 39: System UI stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto
 40: 
 41: ### Scale
 42: 
 43: | Style | Size    | Weight | Usage          |
 44: | ----- | ------- | ------ | -------------- |
 45: | H1    | 48-72px | 800    | Hero headlines |
 46: | H2    | 36-48px | 600    | Section titles |
 47: | H3    | 24px    | 600    | Card titles    |
 48: | Body  | 16px    | 400    | Paragraphs     |
 49: | Small | 14px    | 500    | Captions       |
 50: 
 51: ---
 52: 
 53: ## Spacing
 54: 
 55: Base unit: 4px
 56: 
 57: - xs: 4px
 58: - sm: 8px
 59: - md: 16px
 60: - lg: 24px
 61: - xl: 32px
 62: - 2xl: 48px
 63: - 3xl: 64px
 64: 
 65: ---
 66: 
 67: ## Border Radius
 68: 
 69: - sm: 6px
 70: - md: 8px
 71: - lg: 12px
 72: - xl: 16px
 73: - 2xl: 24px
 74: - full: 9999px
 75: 
 76: ---
 77: 
 78: ## Shadows
 79: 
 80: - sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)
 81: - md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)
 82: - lg: 0 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)
 83: - xl: 0 20px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)
 84: - 2xl: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)
 85: 
 86: ---
 87: 
 88: ## Components
 89: 
 90: ### Buttons
 91: 
 92: - **Primary:** Gradient background, white text, shadow
 93: - **Secondary:** Gray background, dark text
 94: - **Outline:** Transparent, border, hover fill
 95: - **Ghost:** Transparent, hover background
 96: - **Sizes:** sm (32px), md (36px), lg (40px), xl (48px)
 97: 
 98: ### Cards
 99: 
100: - Background: white/card
101: - Border: 1px border with low opacity
102: - Radius: 16px (rounded-2xl)
103: - Padding: 24px
104: - Hover: Elevated shadow
105: 
106: ### Inputs
107: 
108: - Height: 36px
109: - Border: 1px solid border
110: - Radius: 6px
111: - Focus: Ring with primary color
112: 
113: ---
114: 
115: ## Patterns
116: 
117: ### Hero Section
118: 
119: - Full-width with gradient background overlay
120: - Centered text with gradient headline
121: - Two CTA buttons (primary gradient + outline)
122: - Feature cards in 4-column grid
123: - Stats section with colored numbers
124: 
125: ### Navigation
126: 
127: - Fixed top, blur background
128: - Logo left, links center, CTA right
129: - Dropdown menus for categories
130: 
131: ### Footer
132: 
133: - Dark background (slate-900)
134: - 4-column link grid
135: - Social icons
136: - Copyright bar
137: 
138: ---
139: 
140: ## Animations
141: 
142: ### Transitions
143: 
144: - Default: 300ms ease
145: - Quick: 200ms ease
146: - Slow: 500ms ease
147: 
148: ### Effects
149: 
150: - Hover lift: translateY(-4px)
151: - Hover scale: scale(1.05)
152: - Fade in: opacity 0 → 1
153: - Slide up: translateY(20px) → 0
</file>

