<file path="README.md">
  1: # ScholarFlow
  2: 
  3: > **AI-Powered Research Paper Collaboration Hub**
  4: 
  5: ScholarFlow is a modern research paper management and collaboration platform designed to streamline academic workflows. Upload, organize, search, and collaborate on research papers with AI-powered insights and smart organization features.
  6: 
  7: [![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.2.4-blue)](./CHANGELOG.md)
  8: [![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache%202.0-green)](./LICENSE.md)
  9: [![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-100%25-blue)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
 10: [![Next.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Next.js-16-black)](https://nextjs.org/)
 11: [![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-Node.js-green)](https://expressjs.com/)
 12: 
 13: ## 📦 Recent Releases
 14: 
 15: - **1.2.2 (2026-06-16)** — Patch: fixed OAuth account-switching 401s and profile-picture reset on sign-in. See [CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md).
 16: - **1.2.1** — Phase 3: dashboard shell, new admin pages, user preferences.
 17: - **1.2.0** — Phase 2: auth pages, onboarding flow.
 18: 
 19: ## 🚀 Live Demo
 20: 
 21: - **Frontend**: [ScholarFlow App](https://scholar-flow-ai.vercel.app)
 22: - **API**: [Backend API](https://scholar-flow-api.vercel.app/api/health)
 23: 
 24: ## ✨ Features
 25: 
 26: ### 📝 Rich Text Editing & Paper Management
 27: 
 28: - **Rich Text Editor**: Full-featured TipTap-based editor for research papers with advanced formatting, tables, lists, and more
 29: - **Auto-save & Drafts**: Debounced auto-save, manual save, and draft/publish workflow with real-time status
 30: - **Export to PDF/DOCX**: One-click export with embedded images and professional styling
 31: - **Image Upload**: Drag-and-drop or paste images directly into the editor, with S3 storage and resizing
 32: - **Smart Upload**: Drag-and-drop PDF upload with automatic metadata extraction
 33: - **AI Metadata**: Automatic title, author, and abstract extraction from PDFs
 34: - **Advanced Search**: Full-text search with filters (author, date, type, keywords)
 35: - **PDF Preview**: Secure in-app PDF viewer with responsive design
 36: 
 37: ### 🤝 Sharing & Collaboration
 38: 
 39: - **Email Sharing**: Share papers via email with permission management (view/edit)
 40: - **Workspace Collaboration**: Invite users to collections and workspaces with role-based access
 41: 
 42: - **Multiple Auth Options**: Google OAuth, GitHub OAuth, and email/password
 43: - **Secure Sessions**: JWT-based authentication with refresh tokens
 44: - **Password Recovery**: Secure password reset with email verification
 45: - **Production Security**: Rate limiting, input sanitization, CORS protection
 46: 
 47: ### 🎯 Modern UI/UX
 48: 
