121: ## Architecture Rules
122: Frontend and backend are fully decoupled — REST API only.
123: Frontend: UI, RTK Query, NextAuth sessions, Redux state.
124: Backend: business logic, Prisma, S3, Stripe, JWT.
125: NEVER import backend code into frontend.
126: NEVER use Prisma in frontend.
127: NEVER bypass the REST API layer.
128: NEVER store files locally in production — use S3.
129: NEVER expose AWS credentials or S3 bucket names in frontend code.
