323: ## Next.js 16 Specific Rules
324: 
325: ### Async Request APIs (Breaking change — fully enforced in v16)
326: params, searchParams, cookies(), headers(), draftMode()
327: are ALL async. Must always be awaited.
328: 
329:   CORRECT:
330:     const { id } = await props.params
331:     const store = await cookies()
332:     const list = await headers()
333: 
334:   NEVER:
335:     const { id } = props.params  (synchronous — removed in v16)
336:     const store = cookies()      (synchronous — removed in v16)
337: 
338: Type helpers (generated by next typegen):
339:   Page components:   PageProps<'/path/[param]'>
340:   Layout components: LayoutProps
341:   Route handlers:    RouteContext
342: 
343: ### Routing
344: middleware.ts is renamed to proxy.ts in this project.
345: The exported function is named proxy, not middleware.
346: NEVER recreate middleware.ts — use proxy.ts only.
